-<main><div class="tag">HERMES POCKET / SETUP</div><h1>Let's get connected</h1>
-<p>Save up to five home Wi-Fi networks. Pocket tests each new password before saving it.</p>
-<p id="session-status" role="status">Checking your setup session...</p>
-<button id="retry-status" type="button" class="secondary">Check status</button>
-<section aria-labelledby="saved-heading"><h2 id="saved-heading">Saved Wi-Fi</h2>
-<p id="connection" role="status">Checking Pocket's Wi-Fi...</p>
-<p id="hermes-note">Wi-Fi and Hermes availability are separate. If Pocket says Hermes is unreachable, check its bridge connection or pairing even when Wi-Fi is connected.</p>
-<p id="profile-count">Checking saved networks...</p><ul id="profiles" aria-label="Saved Wi-Fi networks"></ul>
-<small id="storage-note"></small></section>
-<section aria-labelledby="wifi-heading"><h2 id="wifi-heading">Add or update Wi-Fi</h2>
-<form id="wifi" novalidate>
-<label for="networks">Nearby networks - 2.4 GHz</label><select id="networks"><option value="">Choose a network...</option></select>
-<button id="scan" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>Scan Wi-Fi</button>
-<p id="netstatus" role="status">Scan for nearby networks, or type a hidden network's name below. Open networks are unsupported.</p>
-<label for="ssid">Network name</label><input id="ssid" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" maxlength="32" aria-describedby="ssid-help" placeholder="Select above, or type a hidden network">
-<small id="ssid-help">Use your router's Wi-Fi name, including spaces and capitals. Maximum 32 UTF-8 bytes.</small>
-<label for="password">Wi-Fi password</label><input id="password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" maxlength="63" placeholder="Your home Wi-Fi password">
-<label><input id="showpass" type="checkbox">Show password</label>
-<button id="join" type="submit" disabled>Test and save Wi-Fi</button>
-</form><button id="cancel" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>Cancel Wi-Fi test</button>
-<p id="result" class="message" role="alert" aria-live="assertive"></p>
-<small>Existing Wi-Fi profiles and Hermes pairing stay saved if a test fails or is cancelled. To change a saved password, enter that network's name again.</small></section>
-<details><summary>Hermes pairing - optional</summary>
-<p id="pairing-state" role="status">Your existing pairing is preserved by default.</p>
-<p>Blank fields keep stored values. Only fields you enter here are updated when you tap Save Hermes pairing.</p>
-<form id="pairing" novalidate>
-<label for="windows">Windows bridge HTTPS address</label><input id="windows" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" placeholder="https://your-bridge.example" maxlength="192">
-<label for="linux">Linux bridge HTTPS address</label><input id="linux" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" placeholder="https://your-bridge.example" maxlength="192">
-<label for="token">Pocket pairing token</label><input id="token" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" maxlength="128">
-<label for="ca">Bridge CA certificate - optional</label><textarea id="ca" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" maxlength="2048" rows="4"></textarea>
-<small>Use only your dedicated Pocket pairing token. Saved pairing values are never shown on this page.</small>
-<button id="pair-save" type="submit" disabled>Save Hermes pairing</button>
